From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 14:35:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Mockups for the plant-visuals research (not for merge)

PS_MOCK=frame,pose,value,plate turns on each experiment in ps-view:
frame (narrower FOV, canopy-aimed framing, muted lawn and ground, no
treeline), pose (age-dependent leaf elevation plus per-leaf jitter,
render-only), value (leaf shade from the sim's shade signal plus
per-leaf hue offsets) and plate (a paper sweep instead of the garden).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PYHSStmW8euWTFw9V2T41C
